  "description": "After several visits from the Reaper, Dohyung's life is constantly under peril. Although Dohyung is saved by the goblin, and falls in love with him, he won't easily reveal his identity... What is the fate of these two heading towards two different moments in time?\n\nDo-hyun is on the verge of dying every time due to Cha's constant gambit. Thanks to his guardian, a goblin, he barely manages to get through a crises. He falls in love with his guardian, but the goblin doesn't easily open up about identity or feelings... With two moments facing each other at different times, what is the fate of the two?",
